      "last_source_update_basis": "dated official attachment label and resource filename",
      "notes": "The official listed-company page exposes the current PDF dated 1 September 2026. The PDF has no extractable table grid, so the approved parser uses byte-pinned positioned text and primary expiry-date anchors. All 383 rows retain the approved public fields: name, raw identifier, registered office, activities, source expiry date and the source update field as outcome_raw. Free-text notes and page-layout metadata remain outside the public contract. The page itself explicitly defines the listed-company population; no free-text field is used to infer a different legal status."
    },
