      "last_source_update_basis": "dated official attachment label, document heading and official page update",
      "notes": "The official page and current PDF explicitly describe a combined population of enrolled companies and companies requesting enrolment. The table exposes row-level listing dates and an explicit Aggiornamento in corso marker, but no separate applicant flag. The parser therefore maps only source-explicit row signals: date-pair rows without X are listed; X rows are renewal_update_in_progress; no pending/applicant status is inferred from blank dates. Two dot-separated date pairs are normalised without changing digits; compound non-canonical identifiers remain raw; one blank section remains an empty activity list."
